/* 全镇16条跨周长线剧本库 / 庄园·警局·雾角塔·街机厅·旧病房·钟塔·干船坞等 / 多阶段差分 */

:: MP Grand Quest Danube Salon [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">>
<<effects>>
<<set _stg to ($mpQuestDanubeSalon or 0)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Danube Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Danube Street">>
<</if>>

<<if _stg is 0>>
	你驻足在灰白色庄园的侧门外，低沉优雅的大提琴曲正顺着半开的雕花气窗流淌而出，曲调里却透着一股说不出的孤寂。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨声掩去了响动。<<else>>四周静谧无声。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[把握时机推进调查 (0:15)|MP Grand Quest Danube Salon Resolve]]>><<set $mpQuestDanubeSalon to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestDanubeSalon to 1>><<pass 15>><<stress -5>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestDanubeSalon_stg_1")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 1>>
	你轻轻推开虚掩的侧门步入偏厅。花园回廊下，一位蒙着黑色蕾丝面纱的乐手正独自拉着琴弦，琴盒里放着半张被撕碎的晚宴名单。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜深无人察觉。<<else>>光线照亮了纹理。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[把握时机推进调查 (0:18)|MP Grand Quest Danube Salon Resolve]]>><<set $mpQuestDanubeSalon to 2>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestDanubeSalon to 1>><<pass 18>><<stress -5>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestDanubeSalon_stg_2")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 2>>
	等一曲终了，你上前替乐手拾起滑落在地的琴弓。对方轻声向你道谢，并暗示白公馆的主人正在地下酒窖里密谋转移一批来历不明的古董。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if ($stress or 0) gte 3500>>你深呼吸稳住心神。<<else>>你全神贯注地观察。<</if>>
