	当你再次经过花园回廊时，蒙面乐手已悄然离去，只在石凳上为你留下了一枚纯银音符胸针。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨声掩去了响动。<<else>>四周静谧无声。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[把握时机推进调查 (0:12)|MP Grand Quest Danube Salon Resolve]]>><<set $mpQuestDanubeSalon to 7>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestDanubeSalon to 1>><<pass 12>><<stress -5>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestDanubeSalon_stg_7")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>>
